328
00:38:46,972 --> 00:38:47,907
Eu o odeio!

329
00:38:47,974 --> 00:38:50,043
Eu o odeio!

330
00:38:50,110 --> 00:38:51,644
Eu o odeio!

331
00:38:51,711 --> 00:38:52,778
Eu o odeio!

